 "name": "SHONEN KNIFE AT THE TOTE w/ MOLER",
 "description": "SHONEN KNIFE re-cuttin’ Australia/NZ 2026\n \nShonen Knife – ever glowing. Ever sharp. As they continue to ride their all out rocking planet with their ever-vescent neon popping punk fun - from Japan 45 years going strong. With the upcoming release on AUG 21 of their Re-Cut seminal 1992 album Let’s Knife in Australia/NZ via Valve/MGM – Naoko, Atsuko and Risa cut into the sugar lines of their current world touring to chop it all up in their favourite wonderland of oz. Twist em’ up barbie!\n\nMOLER\nAussie indie rock icons MOLER are firing on all cylinders following the release of their blistering new album 69—their second full-length release since their 1997 ARIA-nominated debut Golden Duck. Bursting with fuzzy guitars, razor-sharp hooks and Riot Grrrl attitude, 69 captures the unmistakable Moler sound: raw, melodic, loud and gloriously unpredictable. On stage, those songs take on a life of their own, delivered with the intensity, chemistry and infectious energy that have become the hallmark of a Moler show. It's a fierce statement  from a band reborn, proving Moler remains every bit as vital, uncompromising and electrifying as ever. Check out all things Moler here: https://linktr.ee/MolerMolerMoler  ",
